## Доказательства

```text
N-01  rows=[(1,'old',1,1)]  del stuck
N-02  UPDATE SET id=1 → UNIQUE constraint failed
N-03  status 5 → 0
N-04  status 7 → 1 on missing row
N-05  del=NULL stored and treated outside {0,1}
```

Код: `_update_not_matching_data`, `_mark_rows_missing_in_source`, `_resolve_delete_mark_values`, отсутствие guard в `_validate_init_params` / `_check_key`.
